OL,3,ADeadly fire breaks out at Canada
OL,4,Amilitary base
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire near a Canadian military
OL,7,Fbase in Alberta has killed and injured
OL,8,Fsome people, the defence minister said,
OL,9,Fwithout confirming the number of
OL,10,Fcasualties.
OL,12,FThe Canadian Armed Forces were working
OL,13,Fwith local authorities to manage the
OL,14,Ffire and were looking into what caused
OL,15,Fit, David McGuinty said, describing the
OL,16,Fsituation as "very, very active and
OL,17,Fdelicate".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
